      "n": 1,
      "text": "second seat on the same machine; run through the real verifier's scope criterion. Version 2 of SR-1.35 adds fourteen paths to every task's scope, since the verifier walks every commit since the base and each path below was touched by a commit in that range. Fix PRs since version 1: changelog.d/444-request-whole.md, scripts/sign/owner-key-preload.mjs, scripts/sign/owner-sign.mjs, src/engine/contracts.mjs, test/contract-request-whole.test.mjs, test/owner-sign.test.mjs, test/service-windows.test.mjs, test/licence-merge-default.test.mjs, test/contracts-scope-vault.test.mjs, changelog.d/scope-vault-bus.md. Touched while the speed work was built: README.md, src/engine/seg2.mjs, src/engine/segindex.mjs, test/segindex.test.mjs; the last three no longer exist at head. No criterion changes, and none of these widens what a criterion allows.",
